# Django Project Structure Guide

This is a Django web application for data analytics focused on company information and industry chains.

## Main Project Structure

- **Project Root**: [manage.py](mdc:manage.py) - Django management script
- **Main Settings**: [mysite/settings.py](mdc:mysite/settings.py) - Django configuration
- **Main URL Config**: [mysite/urls.py](mdc:mysite/urls.py) - Root URL patterns
- **Primary App**: [data_hall/](mdc:data_hall) - Main application directory

## Core Application (data_hall)

### Models & Data Layer
- **Models**: [data_hall/models.py](mdc:data_hall/models.py) - Database models for companies, industry chains, rankings, financing
- **Admin**: [data_hall/admin.py](mdc:data_hall/admin.py) - Django admin configuration
- **Database**: MySQL database named 'demo' (configured in settings)

### Views & API Layer  
- **Views**: [data_hall/views.py](mdc:data_hall/views.py) - Main view logic (38KB, 1000+ lines)
- **API Views**: [data_hall/api_views.py](mdc:data_hall/api_views.py) - REST API endpoints
- **Serializers**: [data_hall/serializers.py](mdc:data_hall/serializers.py) - DRF serializers
- **Forms**: [data_hall/forms.py](mdc:data_hall/forms.py) - Django forms
- **URLs**: [data_hall/urls.py](mdc:data_hall/urls.py) - App URL patterns

### Frontend & Static Files
- **Templates**: [data_hall/templates/data_hall/](mdc:data_hall/templates/data_hall) - HTML templates
- **Static Files**: [data_hall/static/data_hall/](mdc:data_hall/static/data_hall) - CSS, JS, images
- **Key Templates**: 
  - [base.html](mdc:data_hall/templates/data_hall/base.html) - Main layout
  - [index.html](mdc:data_hall/templates/data_hall/index.html) - Homepage
  - [enterprise.html](mdc:data_hall/templates/data_hall/enterprise.html) - Company details

### Key Data Models
- **CompanyInfo**: Main company data with location, industry, scale info
- **IndustryChain**: Industry chain definitions with hierarchical structure
- **ChainPoint**: Nodes in industry chains with parent-child relationships  
- **CompanyRanking**: Company scoring across 5 dimensions (dev potential, expansion, innovation, etc.)
- **CompanyFinancing**: Investment and funding history
- **Province/City/District**: Geographic hierarchy

## Development Setup
- **Virtual Environment**: [.venv/](mdc:.venv) - Python virtual environment
- **Dependencies**: Managed via pip (no requirements.txt visible)
- **Language**: Chinese (zh-hans) as default language
- **Database**: MySQL connection to localhost:3306

## Key Features
- Company data visualization and analytics
- Industry chain mapping and analysis  
- Company ranking system with multi-dimensional scoring
- Geographic data visualization (maps)
- User authentication and registration
- REST API for data access
